          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he took the seven loaves and the fish, gave thanks to God, broke them, and gave them to the disciples; and the disciples gave them to the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They all ate and had enough. Then the disciples took up seven baskets full of pieces left over. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The number of men who ate was 4,000, not counting the women and children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
